**DIRAC
.TITLE
  MgF, ^2Sigma
.WAVE F 
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
15
.INTFLG
1 1 0
# T- operator - employ it only with the KU wave-function !
# this operator is carrying factor of 2 !
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM'
 DSIGMADOT
 'XNUCFIEL'
 'YNUCFIEL'
 'ZNUCFIEL'
 COMFACTOR
 2.0000
.TRSMIX
#.ONESYS
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
#.RELCCSD
*END OF
